  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模組。用心製作。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Bareback Horse Riding 允許玩家在不裝備馬鞍的情況下騎乘馬匹。你可以直接帶上剛剛發現的馬匹，無需將其遺留並在地牢寶箱中翻找馬鞍。預設情況下，不裝馬鞍騎馬會給玩家與馬匹施加「緩慢」效果。你還可在設定檔中啟用每 15 秒受到一次傷害的選項。穿著皮革褲子可以防止緩慢/傷害，但每次抵銷效果時都會消耗其耐久度。所有功能皆可自訂設定，且可單獨開關。<br><br>馴服機制維持不變。馬匹必須先建立友好關係並完成馴服後，方可進行操控。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"相依性\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum&#x27;s RPG 套裝\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/both.svg\" alt=\"環境：客戶端與伺服器\" width=\"293\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>shouldReceiveSlownessDuringRidingWithoutSaddle</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">騎乘未裝馬鞍的馬時，玩家（與馬）是否應獲得緩慢效果。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>shouldDamageDuringRidingWithoutSaddle</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">騎乘未裝馬鞍的馬時，玩家是否應受到傷害。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>leatherPantsNegateEffect</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用時，穿著皮革褲騎乘未裝馬鞍的馬是否能抵銷緩慢/傷害效果。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>ticksBetweenDamage</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default 300, min 1, max 72000</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若已啟用，騎乘未裝馬鞍的馬時每隔多少刻（ticks）受到一次傷害。1 秒 = 20 刻</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>halfHeartDamageAmount</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default 2, min 1, max 100</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">未裝馬鞍騎馬時對玩家造成的傷害量（以半顆心為單位）。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>leatherPantsLoseDurabilityOnNegation</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">皮革褲在抵銷傷害時是否每次都會消耗耐久度。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">馬匹可以在未裝備馬鞍的情況下被騎乘：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/bareback-horse-riding/a.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">啟用 'shouldReceiveSlownessDuringRidingWithoutSaddle' 時會施加緩慢效果：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/bareback-horse-riding/d.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">或啟用 'shouldDamageDuringRidingWithoutSaddle' 時的偶爾傷害：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/bareback-horse-riding/b.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">穿著皮革褲可防止緩慢/傷害發生。這確實會消耗耐久度：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/bareback-horse-riding/c.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"注意事項與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載來源仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內，您可自由在任何整合包中使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的概覽與更多資訊。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於我無法在眾多獨立的模組頁面上追蹤留言，因此已關閉留言功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，歡迎前往 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 專案頁</a>。謝謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
